  "title": {
    "type": "text",
    "$t": "NASA Thài-khong-jîn"
  },
  "content": {
    "type": "html",
    "$t": "<h1 style=\"text-align: left;\"><span><span style=\"font-size: x-large;\"><b>NASA太空人</b></span></span></h1><p><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><span><b>作者：</b></span></span><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><b>高嘉徽</b></span></p><div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><br /></div></div><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">Góa chū sè-hàn tō chin kah-ì khòaⁿ kho-ha̍k-lūi ê chheh, m̄-koán sī tōng-bu̍t--ê ia̍h-sī gōa-chhiⁿ-kiû ê chheh góa lóng chin ài tha̍k.</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">Kin-á-ji̍t beh kóng--ê, sī iú-koan gōa-chhiⁿ ê tāi-chì. Chū góa kok-tiong tō tha̍k-tio̍h tē-kiû-lâng teng-lio̍k goe̍h-niû-téng, koh ū siu-chi̍p goe̍h-niû ê chio̍h-thâu lâi chò si̍t-giām, khòaⁿ ū gōa-chhiⁿ-lâng ê chûn-chāi--bô.</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">Tē-kiû-lâng tùi gōa-chhiⁿ sī chiok hòⁿ-hiân--ê, tē 1 ê teng-lio̍k goe̍h-niû--ê sī Bí-kok-lâng, tī hit ê nî-tāi, chit chióng tāi-chì sī hi-hán--ê, NASA ê thài-khong-jîn thè jîn-lūi oân-sêng bāng-sióng.</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">Góa tha̍k ko-tiong 1 nî ê sî, ū siūⁿ-beh tōa-hàn liáu khì Bí-kok NASA ê tiong-sim khì khòaⁿ-māi--leh. Hit-sî gín-á-tioh ê góa chin-chiàⁿ sī chiok siūⁿ-beh khì NASA--ê. M̄-koh chit-má ê góa khòaⁿ hit-sî ê góa, si̍t-chāi ū-kàu thian-chin, he m̄ sī hiah-nī kán-tan ê tāi-chì. Koh ū 1 ê khah hàm ê tāi, tō sī góa ū bat siuⁿ-kòe khì NASA chò thài-khong-jîn ê siūⁿ-hoat, si̍t-chāi ū-kàu hó-chhiò--ê.</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">Sui-bóng tōa-hàn liáu bô si̍t-hiān, m̄-koh o̍h ē-hiáu Tâi-bûn, lâi kì-lo̍k gín-á sî-tāi tùi kho-ha̍k ê kî-thāi, mā sī 1 chân chin te̍k-pia̍t ê tāi-chì. Ǹg-bāng góa ka-tī ē-tàng koh siá-chhut bô kāng-khoán ê chū-jiân chú-tê ê bûn-chiuⁿ.&nbsp;</span></p><div style=\"text-align: justify;\"><br /></div><span></span><span><a name='more'></a></span><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEjY6j1Dmb5w8SvRWrwBQ3yCCHrhfRRyOoj9O-Pqf_HcRQrmtkhIfTGKHIgHLvCvru98IB5SqRZxMNmlBKBfkKkVrwbwceZ5TtOHF1cRys7ofPJJumPLDqeDjaH0MuYklMyYGMi9p2jdTdpr4OPYHRE5gu0QiW8n1TrltI2FA0ahJ86Rs-k4R4cMTlEbeHK8/s3036/%E5%8F%B0%E6%96%87%E9%80%9A%E8%A8%8ABONG%E5%A0%B1359%E6%9C%9F_045.jpg\" imageanchor=\"1\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"><img border=\"0\" data-original-height=\"3036\" data-original-width=\"2150\" height=\"640\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEjY6j1Dmb5w8SvRWrwBQ3yCCHrhfRRyOoj9O-Pqf_HcRQrmtkhIfTGKHIgHLvCvru98IB5SqRZxMNmlBKBfkKkVrwbwceZ5TtOHF1cRys7ofPJJumPLDqeDjaH0MuYklMyYGMi9p2jdTdpr4OPYHRE5gu0QiW8n1TrltI2FA0ahJ86Rs-k4R4cMTlEbeHK8/w454-h640/%E5%8F%B0%E6%96%87%E9%80%9A%E8%A8%8ABONG%E5%A0%B1359%E6%9C%9F_045.jpg\" width=\"454\" /></a></div><br /><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><br /></div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><br /></div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><br /></div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEhDJn1b4-aXdPVniou3PG9UsKNs2yDx83H9Z7CC2XsRHlFthbhm6ywKTosMqfdYpJgwSi7-4HWM3Mgkt2Qi7Xex7s7scF0zg9EuhNvVaKCLvDy71SWfDIFZW7TFhVJ4a2m-LpqpQdeLHnMqEiOQLfPLj3mK6v4zcGjKg_ugSxTEoucGFAorBXLet8ZSuHA0/s1423/359%E5%8F%B0%E6%96%87%E9%80%9A%E8%A8%8ABONG%E5%A0%B1_%E5%B0%81%E9%9D%A2.jpg\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"><img border=\"0